{"path":"numeric/complex/tan","title":"std::tan(std::complex)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>tan<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::complex)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/complex/tan","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Computes complex tangent of a complex value z.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/complex\">&lt;complex&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <br>complex<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> tan<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> complex<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> z <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Computes complex tangent of a complex value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> z\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> complex value\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If no errors occur, the complex tangent of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is returned.\n</p><p>Errors and special cases are handled as if the operation is implemented by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span>i <span class=\"sy2\">*</span></span><code>&nbsp;</code><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/tanh\"><code>std::tanh</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> z<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code>i</code> is the imaginary unit.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Tangent is an analytical function on the complex plain and has no branch cuts. It is periodic with respect to the real component, with period πi, and has poles of the first order along the real line, at coordinates <span class=\"texhtml\">(π(1/2 + n), 0)</span>. However no common floating-point representation is able to represent π/2 exactly, thus there is no value of the argument for which a pole error occurs.\n</p>\nMathematical definition of the tangent is <span class=\"texhtml\">tan z = <span class=\"t-mfrac\"><table><tr><td>i(e<span class=\"t-su\">-iz<br></span>-e<span class=\"t-su\">iz<br></span>)</td></tr><tr><td>e<span class=\"t-su\">-iz<br></span>+e<span class=\"t-su\">iz<br></span></td></tr></table></span></span>.\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;complex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/fixed\"><span class=\"kw1801\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fixed</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// behaves like real tangent along the real line</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"tan\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/tan\"><span class=\"kw1343\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tan</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" ( tan(1) = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/tan\"><span class=\"kw1343\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tan</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// behaves like tanh along the imaginary line</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"tan\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z2 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/tan\"><span class=\"kw1343\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tan</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z2<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" (tanh(1) = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/tanh\"><span class=\"kw1350\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tanh</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>tan(1.000000,0.000000) = (1.557408,0.000000) ( tan(1) = 1.557408)\ntan(0.000000,1.000000) = (0.000000,0.761594) (tanh(1) = 0.761594)</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/sin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sin<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::complex)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes sine of a complex number (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\sin{z}}\">sin(z)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/cos\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cos<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::complex)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes cosine of a complex number (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\cos{z}}\">cos(z)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/atan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>atan<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::complex)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes arc tangent of a complex number (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\arctan{z}}\">arctan(z)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/tan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tan</span><span>tanf</span><span>tanl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes tangent (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\tan{x}}\">tan(x)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/tan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tan<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::valarray)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  applies the function <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/tan\">std::tan</a></span> to each element of valarray <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/ctan\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>ctan</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/complex","title":"std::complex"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::tan(std::complex)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Computes complex tangent of a complex value z."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"z"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If no errors occur, the complex tangent of z is returned."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Tangent is an analytical function on the complex plain and has no branch cuts."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"sin(std::complex)","note":"computes sine of a complex number (sin(z))"},{"label":"cos(std::complex)","note":"computes cosine of a complex number (cos(z))"},{"label":"atan(std::complex)","note":"computes arc tangent of a complex number (arctan(z))"},{"label":"tan, tanf, tanl","note":"computes tangent (tan(x))"},{"label":"tan(std::valarray)","note":"applies the function std::tan to each element of valarray"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":289,"codeBlockCount":2}
